# Cloudflare Pages Redirects
# Convention: every page is served at its clean URL (no .html) and the .html
# form 301-redirects to it. Cloudflare Pages already serves clean URLs for
# *.html files automatically; this file is belt-and-suspenders and makes the
# mapping explicit for Search Console.
#
# MAINTENANCE: when you add a new blog page, add its .html -> clean rule here
# (alphabetical order), or the .html URL will still work via Cloudflare's
# automatic clean-URL handling but the explicit rule keeps this file accurate.
# Keep the exact list in sync with sitemap.xml (clean URLs only).

# Homepage
/index.html / 301

